{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/10/2830759/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NARUTOがついに終わってしまった。\nいや、私\n単行本派なんで私の中では\nまだ終わってないのだけど(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか推しが卒業するのと\n同じ気分かも...(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうNARUTOの成長を\n今後見れないなんて...(´•̥ ̯ •̥`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NARUTOは私に生き方も\n家族の大切さ、友達の大切さ、\n命の大切さ\n全部全部教えてくれた漫画でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NARUTO！岸本斉史先生！\n本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私インドアだから\nあんまり人とご飯に行ったり\nしないんだけどここ最近で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬あやねちゃん\n♬りさこ\n♬ザキとまいちゅん\n♬琴子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とお仕事の合間とかに\nご飯に行ったι(｀･-･´)/\n私がこんなにアクティブに動くなんて\n奇跡ですよみなさん('ﾛ'('ﾛ'('ﾛ' )!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/10/2830759/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんとメイクしてないから...\nと顔を隠すまいちゅんとザキ子♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなと軽い話から深い話まで\n出来て良かったなあ～(๑⁰ -⁰)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/10/2830759/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/10/2830759/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんちゃんはアルバムの曲投票できたら、何に投票する？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"755でも答えたんだけどその時と\n若干答え変わってるかもだけど(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が唯一参加してる楽曲の\n【あの日 僕は咄嗟に嘘をついた】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の思い出深い曲\n【ハウス！】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂のアルバムに\n入らないとかあり得ない\n【乃木坂の詩】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなあ～(๑•̀‧̫•́๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日乃木どこ出てました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/10/2830759/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クイズ王との対戦で\nジャンル「NARUTO」に生駒さんと\n「乃木坂46」に\nまあやさん川後さんと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダイジェストになっちゃってたけど(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週も引き続き\n出てるのでお楽しみに"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/10/2830759/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日放送の\nNOGIBINGO!3に出てます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もちょこちょこ映るかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/10/2830759/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"typ